{
	"id": "glassfish",
	"name": "Glass fish",
	"plural": "glass fish",
	"meaning": "A small bottle for scented oil, made at Amarna in the shape of a tilapia from dark blue glass with trails of yellow and white. Glass was a new and precious craft in Akhenaten's time."
